{"_id":"kho0001","name":"Air Fist","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"Perhaps the most basic of all Kiho, Air Fist allows a monk to channel the energy of the wind and lend its speed to his strikes. [CR p.177]","specialRules":"While this Kiho is active, as long as the only attacks you make are unarmed attacks, your Initiative Score is increased by +5. The damage of all unarmed strikes made while this Kiho is active is reduced by an amount equal to your Air Ring.","ring":"air","mastery":3,"type":"internal","cost":3},"effects":[{"name":"Air Fist: Initiative Bonus","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[{"key":"system.initiative.totalMod","mode":2,"value":"5","priority":20}],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"toggleable":true,"description":"Active while making only unarmed attacks"}}}],"sort":100000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0002","name":"Flee The Darkness","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"A member of the Brotherhood is taught the fundamental lesson of keeping his spirit free from the darkness that can envelop all men. [CR p.177]","specialRules":"When this Kiho is activated, you become immune to the influence of the Shadowlands Taint (or other supernatural ailments, such as the influence of the Lying Darkness) for a number of round equal to your Air Ring.","ring":"air","mastery":6,"type":"kharmic","cost":6},"effects":[{"name":"Flee The Darkness (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"kharmic","atemi":false,"instructions":"Kharmic kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":200000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0003","name":"The Great Silence","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"This peculiar technique allows a monk to use a precise attack to disrupt the flow of an individual's chi in such a way that they are unable to speak. [CR p.177]","specialRules":"If successful, the target of this attack is unable to speak for a number of rounds equal to your Air Ring.","ring":"air","mastery":4,"type":"mystical","cost":4},"effects":[{"name":"The Great Silence (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"mystical","atemi":true,"instructions":"Mystical kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":300000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0004","name":"Harmony Of The Mind","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"A gift often possessed by members of the Brotherhood is the ability to quickly and accurately gauge the strength of others, a useful ability both i... [CR p.177]","specialRules":"By making a Contested Air Roll against a target within your line of sight, you may learn one of the following pieces of information: their highest or lowest Ring, their highest Skill Rank, or their highest cost Spiritual Advantage or Disadvantage. For every successful Raise made on this roll, you can gain one additional piece of information.","ring":"air","mastery":5,"type":"mystical","cost":5},"effects":[{"name":"Harmony Of The Mind (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"mystical","atemi":false,"instructions":"Mystical kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":400000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0005","name":"Riding The Clouds","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"By aligning his chi with that of the wind, a monk can make his body light and buoyant, dramatically increasing the distance he can leap. [CR p.178]","specialRules":"While this Kiho is active, you may make a Simple Move Action to leap a maximum distance equal to your Air Ring x10.","ring":"air","mastery":3,"type":"mystical","cost":3},"effects":[{"name":"Riding The Clouds (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"mystical","atemi":false,"instructions":"Mystical kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":500000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0006","name":"Soul Of The Four Winds","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"By bringing their chi in alignment with that of the wind, monks may dramatically increase their reaction time and ability to evade the blows of oth... [CR p.178]","specialRules":"While this Kiho is active, your Armor TN is increased by an amount equal to your Insight Rank plus your Air Ring.","ring":"air","mastery":4,"type":"internal","cost":4},"effects":[{"name":"Soul Of The Four Winds: Armor TN","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"instructions":"Increase Armor TN by Insight Rank + Air Ring (configure manually)"}}}],"sort":600000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0007","name":"Stain Upon The Soul","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"This is a basic martial technique known to many sects of the Brotherhood, but one that is decried by several orders as impure and wicked. [CR p.178]","specialRules":"The target suffers a penalty to all TNs as if he suffered from a number of Wound Ranks equal to your Air Ring. This lasts for a number of rounds equal to your Insight Rank plus your Air Ring.","ring":"air","mastery":3,"type":"martial","cost":3},"effects":[{"name":"Stain Upon The Soul (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"martial","atemi":true,"instructions":"Martial kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":700000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0008","name":"Steal The Air Dragon","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"This Kiho borders upon the Mystical, but is not quite as overt as those slivers of enlightenment. [CR p.178]","specialRules":"While this Kiho is active, you gain additional rolled and kept dice equal to your Air Ring on all Stealth Skill Rolls. This effect lasts a number of minutes equal to your Insight Rank.","ring":"air","mastery":7,"type":"kharmic","cost":7},"effects":[{"name":"Steal The Air Dragon (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"kharmic","atemi":false,"instructions":"Kharmic kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":800000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0009","name":"Way Of The Willow","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"The wind is all around us, and by focusing his chi, a monk may see as the wind does, dramatically increasing his ability to perceive threats and pr... [CR p.178]","specialRules":"","ring":"air","mastery":5,"type":"internal","cost":5},"effects":[{"name":"Way Of The Willow (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"internal","atemi":false,"instructions":"Internal kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":900000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0010","name":"Cleansing Spirit","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"Rain and time wash the mountain, leaving it free from impurities. [CR p.178]","specialRules":"While this Kiho is active, you roll a number of additional dice equal to half your Earth Ring (rounded down) on any roll made to resist the effects of poison or disease.","ring":"earth","mastery":4,"type":"internal","cost":4},"effects":[{"name":"Cleansing Spirit (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"internal","atemi":false,"instructions":"Internal kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":1000000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0011","name":"Earthen Fist","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"Although part of the elemental fist set of Kiho, this particular technique is more defensive than offensive. [CR p.178]","specialRules":"","ring":"earth","mastery":3,"type":"internal","cost":3},"effects":[{"name":"Earthen Fist (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"internal","atemi":false,"instructions":"Internal kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":1100000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0012","name":"Earth Needs No Eyes","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"You can attune yourself to minute vibrations in the earth and use them to detect the movement of others. [CR p.179]","specialRules":"While this Kiho is active you can detect the approach of any creature or individual that moves across the ground within a distance equal to your Insight Rank x50 in feet. This effect lasts a number of minutes equal to your Earth Ring.","ring":"earth","mastery":3,"type":"internal","cost":3},"effects":[{"name":"Earth Needs No Eyes (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"internal","atemi":false,"instructions":"Internal kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":1200000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0013","name":"Embrace The Stone","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"By focusing their chi like that of the mountain, monks may become like stone themselves, turning aside blows and ignoring damage. [CR p.179]","specialRules":"By focusing their chi like that of the mountain, monks may become like stone themselves, turning aside blows and ignoring damage. When you activate this Kiho, you gain a Reduction Rating equal to twice your Earth Ring.","ring":"earth","mastery":5,"type":"mystical","cost":5},"effects":[{"name":"Embrace The Stone: Reduction","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"instructions":"Gain Reduction equal to 2x Earth Ring (configure manually)"}}}],"sort":1300000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0014","name":"Grasp The Earth Dragon","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"[CR p.179]","specialRules":"","ring":"earth","mastery":5,"type":"internal","cost":5},"effects":[{"name":"Grasp The Earth Dragon (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"internal","atemi":true,"instructions":"Internal kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":1400000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0015","name":"Root The Mountain","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"As the Crab say, the mountain does not move, and neither does one who shares its strength. [CR p.179]","specialRules":"","ring":"earth","mastery":5,"type":"internal","cost":5},"effects":[{"name":"Root The Mountain (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"internal","atemi":false,"instructions":"Internal kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":1500000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0016","name":"Speed Of The Mountains","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"Earth is many things, but fleet is not among them. [CR p.179]","specialRules":"The opponent's Water Ring is considered to be two ranks lower for the purposes of determining how far they can move as part of a Move Action. This effect lasts for a number of rounds equal to twice your Earth Ring.","ring":"earth","mastery":4,"type":"kharmic","cost":4},"effects":[{"name":"Speed Of The Mountains (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"kharmic","atemi":true,"instructions":"Kharmic kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":1600000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0017","name":"Way Of The Earth","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"The grip of a monk can be like stone, crushing those who find themselves trapped in his grasp. [CR p.180]","specialRules":"Opponents engaged in a Grapple with you while this Kiho is active suffer a number of additional Wounds per Round equal to your Earth Ring. This damage is inflicted during the Reactions Stage.","ring":"earth","mastery":4,"type":"martial","cost":4},"effects":[{"name":"Way Of The Earth (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"martial","atemi":false,"instructions":"Martial kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":1700000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0018","name":"The Body Is An Anvil","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"A master of the ways of Fire can channel his chi outward. [CR p.180]","specialRules":"While this Kiho is active, your skin becomes extremely hot to the touch, and anyone who touches you, including those who target you with unarmed attacks or those you strike with an unarmed attack, suffer Wounds equal to your Fire Ring. This effect lasts a number of rounds equal to twice your Fire Ring.","ring":"fire","mastery":4,"type":"mystical","cost":4},"effects":[{"name":"The Body Is An Anvil (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"mystical","atemi":false,"instructions":"Mystical kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":1800000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0019","name":"Breaking Blow","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"Fire destroys all it touches, and a monk harnessing his Fire chi can achieve similar effects. [CR p.180]","specialRules":"While this Kiho is active, your unarmed strikes inflict full damage to all non-metal substances, including wood and stone, without inflicting any ill effects on you as a result of punching such objects. This effect lasts a number of minutes equal to your Fire Ring.","ring":"fire","mastery":3,"type":"martial","cost":3},"effects":[{"name":"Breaking Blow (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"martial","atemi":false,"instructions":"Martial kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":1900000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0020","name":"Channel The Fire Dragon","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"Fire cannot be extinguished by more fire, nor can it be quelled with cold. [CR p.180]","specialRules":"While this Kiho is active, any damage you suffer as a result of heat or cold is reduced by -2k2.","ring":"fire","mastery":6,"type":"internal","cost":6},"effects":[{"name":"Channel The Fire Dragon (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"internal","atemi":false,"instructions":"Internal kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":2000000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0021","name":"Dance Of The Flames","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"Filling one's chi with the power of Fire has considerable effects on one's speed as well as one's temperament. [CR p.180]","specialRules":"","ring":"fire","mastery":6,"type":"martial","cost":6},"effects":[{"name":"Dance Of The Flames (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"martial","atemi":false,"instructions":"Martial kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":2100000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0022","name":"Destiny's Strike","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"The force of destiny is powerful, and can be harnessed by those who truly understand their place in the universe. [CR p.180]","specialRules":"","ring":"fire","mastery":4,"type":"martial","cost":4},"effects":[{"name":"Destiny's Strike (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"martial","atemi":false,"instructions":"Martial kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":2200000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0023","name":"Falling Star Strike","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"One of the most blatant and powerful of all Kiho, the Falling Star Strike is a devastating martial attack that can cripple opponents permanently if... [CR p.181]","specialRules":"The unarmed attack inflicts normal damage, plus an additional amount of damage with a DR equal to your Fire Ring in rolled and kept dice. If you are successful, the target is struck Blind for a number of hours equal to your Fire Ring.","ring":"fire","mastery":7,"type":"martial","cost":7},"effects":[{"name":"Falling Star Strike (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"martial","atemi":true,"instructions":"Martial kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":2300000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0024","name":"Fire's Fleeting Speed","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"Fire darts and surges, as do those who carry it in their souls. [CR p.181]","specialRules":"While this Kiho is active, increase the distance you may move when using any Move Action by +5. This effect lasts a number of Rounds equal to your Fire Ring.","ring":"fire","mastery":4,"type":"kharmic","cost":4},"effects":[{"name":"Fire's Fleeting Speed (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"kharmic","atemi":false,"instructions":"Kharmic kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":2400000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0025","name":"Flame Fist","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"By mingling your chi with another's while Fire is ascendant within your body, you can disorient and confuse an opponent, inhibiting their actions. [CR p.181]","specialRules":"An opponent struck by this Kiho's activating atemi strike suffers a TN penalty to all actions equal to three times your Fire Ring. This effect lasts a number of rounds equal to your Fire Ring.","ring":"fire","mastery":3,"type":"martial","cost":3},"effects":[{"name":"Flame Fist (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"martial","atemi":true,"instructions":"Martial kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":2500000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0026","name":"Unbalance The Mind","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"A momentary disruption of the Fire chi within a target can leave them addled and confused. [CR p.181]","specialRules":"","ring":"fire","mastery":5,"type":"mystical","cost":5},"effects":[{"name":"Unbalance The Mind (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"mystical","atemi":true,"instructions":"Mystical kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":2600000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0027","name":"As The Breakers","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"By disrupting the flow of chi through others. [CR p.181]","specialRules":"","ring":"water","mastery":5,"type":"kharmic","cost":5},"effects":[{"name":"As The Breakers (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"kharmic","atemi":true,"instructions":"Kharmic kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":2700000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0028","name":"Buoyed By The Kami","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"A monk whose Water chi is ascendant can resist the siren call of the depths. [CR p.181]","specialRules":"","ring":"water","mastery":3,"type":"mystical","cost":3},"effects":[{"name":"Buoyed By The Kami (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"mystical","atemi":false,"instructions":"Mystical kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":2800000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0029","name":"Chi Protection","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"Perhaps the strangest application of the atemi technique, this Kiho permits a monk to restore or enhance the flow of chi through another's body, ha... [CR p.181]","specialRules":"The individual targeted by the strike regains a number of Wounds equal to your Water Ring, immediately and then at the start of your Turn every subsequent Round for a number of Rounds equal to your Insight Rank.","ring":"water","mastery":4,"type":"martial","cost":4},"effects":[{"name":"Chi Protection (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"martial","atemi":true,"instructions":"Martial kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":2900000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0030","name":"Freezing The Lifeblood","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"This attack disrupts the flow of chi through an opponent's body, paralyzing them for a short time. [CR p.182]","specialRules":"The individual struck by the atemi attack is paralyzed, effectively Stunned and unable to take Move Actions, and may not move under his own power for a number of Rounds equal to your Insight Rank.","ring":"water","mastery":7,"type":"martial","cost":7},"effects":[{"name":"Freezing The Lifeblood (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"martial","atemi":true,"instructions":"Martial kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":3000000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0031","name":"Partaking The Waves","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"Certain monks may channel the power of the ocean into their bodies, moving and flowing away from attacks like the sea itself. [CR p.182]","specialRules":"While this Kiho is active, you gain Reduction equal to your Water Ring. This effect lasts a number of Rounds equal to twice your Water Ring.","ring":"water","mastery":6,"type":"internal","cost":6},"effects":[{"name":"Partaking The Waves: Reduction","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"instructions":"Gain Reduction equal to Water Ring (configure manually)"}}}],"sort":3100000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0032","name":"Ride The Water Dragon","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"To walk with the Water Dragon's power is to harness the incredible restorative abilities of the ocean. [CR p.182]","specialRules":"While this Kiho is active, for a number of Rounds equal to your Insight Rank, you recover Wounds equal to your Water Ring during the Reactions Stage of the Round.","ring":"water","mastery":3,"type":"kharmic","cost":3},"effects":[{"name":"Ride The Water Dragon (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"kharmic","atemi":false,"instructions":"Kharmic kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":3200000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0033","name":"Slap The Wave","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"A powerful expression of inner strength, this Kiho channels the monk's chi outward in an explosive wave that carries the power of a tsunami. [CR p.182]","specialRules":"Everyone in your forward facing arc and within a distance of your Water Ring x5 feet must succeed at a Contested Water Roll against you, or become Dazed.","ring":"water","mastery":7,"type":"mystical","cost":7},"effects":[{"name":"Slap The Wave (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"mystical","atemi":false,"instructions":"Mystical kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":3300000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0034","name":"Waves In All Things","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"Water flows through all things, including the earth. [CR p.182]","specialRules":"The effects of this strike are felt by one opponent who is in contact with either the water or earth (whichever one was struck) and who is within a number of feet equal to your Water Ring x10.","ring":"water","mastery":4,"type":"mystical","cost":4},"effects":[{"name":"Waves In All Things (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"mystical","atemi":false,"instructions":"Mystical kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":3400000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0035","name":"Banish All Shadows","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"[CR p.182]","specialRules":"","ring":"void","mastery":7,"type":"kharmic","cost":7},"effects":[{"name":"Banish All Shadows (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"kharmic","atemi":true,"instructions":"Kharmic kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":3500000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0036","name":"Eight Directions Awareness","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"Some monks are at a state of harmony with the world to such extent that they are aware of everything around them. [CR p.183]","specialRules":"While this Kiho is active, you become aware of all living things within a distance equal to your Void Ring x10 feet.","ring":"void","mastery":5,"type":"mystical","cost":5},"effects":[{"name":"Eight Directions Awareness (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"mystical","atemi":false,"instructions":"Mystical kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":3600000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0037","name":"Silent Solace","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"Proper use of nerve strikes can impede not only the physical, but the spiritual as well. [CR p.183]","specialRules":"This effect lasts a number of Rounds equal to your Void Ring.","ring":"void","mastery":5,"type":"kharmic","cost":5},"effects":[{"name":"Silent Solace (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"kharmic","atemi":true,"instructions":"Kharmic kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":3700000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0038","name":"Song Of The World","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"By listening to the song of the elements around him, a monk may perceive the universe slightly ahead of all others. [CR p.183]","specialRules":"If successful, his Initiative Score is reduced by 5 and yours is increased by the same amount.","ring":"void","mastery":3,"type":"kharmic","cost":3},"effects":[{"name":"Song Of The World (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"kharmic","atemi":false,"instructions":"Kharmic kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":3800000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0039","name":"Spin The Kharmic Wheel","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"Theoretically one of the most powerful Kiho known to exist, Spin the Kharmic Wheel is known only to a handful of reclusive masters within the Broth... [CR p.183]","specialRules":"","ring":"void","mastery":8,"type":"kharmic","cost":8},"effects":[{"name":"Spin The Kharmic Wheel (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"kharmic","atemi":false,"instructions":"Kharmic kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":3900000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0040","name":"Touch The Void Dragon","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"Certain orders of the Brotherhood are adept at aligning their chi with the dominant Element in the environment around them, drawing strength from t... [CR p.183]","specialRules":"While this Kiho is active, one of your Rings and its associated Traits are considered one Rank higher. Which Ring is affected depends upon the environment.","ring":"void","mastery":4,"type":"internal","cost":4},"effects":[{"name":"Touch The Void Dragon (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"internal","atemi":false,"instructions":"Internal kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":4000000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0041","name":"To The Last Breath","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"With a simple exhalation, a monk can expend his energy into the universe around him, allowing others to partake of it as they wish. [CR p.183]","specialRules":"","ring":"void","mastery":3,"type":"kharmic","cost":3},"effects":[{"name":"To The Last Breath (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"kharmic","atemi":false,"instructions":"Kharmic kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":4100000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"kho0042","name":"Void Fist","type":"kiho","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Kiho","system":{"description":"Unlike other atemi attacks, the Void Fist is a normal unarmed strike that would appear, if observed, to be damaging to its target. [CR p.184]","specialRules":"A successful strike inflicts no damage, but you immediately regain two Void Points.","ring":"void","mastery":4,"type":"martial","cost":4},"effects":[{"name":"Void Fist (Activate)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/kiho.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"toggleable":true,"type":"martial","atemi":true,"instructions":"Martial kiho. Toggle on when active. See description for effects."}}}],"sort":4200000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
